1
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,325
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,434 --> 00:00:27,719
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,597
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,310
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,002
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,687
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:48,356
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,816
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:58,577
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,625 --> 00:00:59,244
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,118 --> 00:01:04,082
=Episode 12=

12
00:01:04,679 --> 00:01:05,519
Weiyue, wake up!

13
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,920
(Feng Weiyue,)

14
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,119
- how dare you cross me?
- (Weiyue! Weiyue!)

15
00:01:09,559 --> 00:01:11,360
- This is what you get.
- (Wake up, Weiyue!)

16
00:01:11,639 --> 00:01:13,519
Please accept my condolences,
Dowager Consort.

17
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:20,559
It seems Weiyue has already

18
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,039
passed away.

19
00:01:23,599 --> 00:01:25,440
How... How could this be?

20
00:01:27,679 --> 00:01:28,679
It was you.

21
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:31,360
You schemed and murdered her!

22
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,760
There was nothing in that box.

23
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:36,559
I was only joking with her.

24
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,159
How could I have known

25
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,679
that she'd merely reach out her hand

26
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,079
and something would go wrong suddenly?

27
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,960
Could it be that Prince of Rong

28
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:46,480
conspired with her to frame me?

29
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,559
He is truly ruthless.

30
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,760
Just because I'm at odds with him,

31
00:01:51,199 --> 00:01:53,760
he'd sacrifice even his own wife.

32
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,960
Mo Xuanji.

33
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,599
Have you no shame?

34
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:07,719
You've had a fright today,
Dowager Consort.

35
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:10,599
You should go rest in the side chamber.

36
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,800
How dare you!

37
00:02:13,079 --> 00:02:14,000
Let go!

38
00:02:14,519 --> 00:02:16,119
Weiyue!

39
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,199
Let go!

40
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:26,039
What bad luck.

41
00:02:26,239 --> 00:02:27,599
Carrying a corpse on an auspicious day.

42
00:02:27,679 --> 00:02:28,480
The princess consort

43
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:29,440
threw her own life away.

44
00:02:29,679 --> 00:02:31,719
This Grand Princess's Estate
is like hell.

45
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:32,639
And she

46
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:33,920
rushed right over to die.

47
00:02:34,679 --> 00:02:35,599
Don't say that.

48
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:37,760
The negative energy here is heavy.

49
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,320
Let's go to a temple to pray after this.

50
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:39,920
Let's go.

51
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:46,039
Your Highness!

52
00:02:46,519 --> 00:02:48,400
Let me go report to the Grand Princess.

53
00:02:49,679 --> 00:02:51,480
Yuya, you just lost your beloved wife.

54
00:02:51,679 --> 00:02:54,159
I won't hold your trespassing
against you.

55
00:02:54,519 --> 00:02:56,239
But even beating a dog
depends on its master.

56
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:57,519
Yuya, don't you think...

57
00:02:57,519 --> 00:02:59,079
Where is Weiyue?

58
00:03:22,679 --> 00:03:23,519
Weiyue...

59
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,440
Weiyue,

60
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,239
I'm sorry.

61
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,400
I came too late.

62
00:03:44,079 --> 00:03:44,920
I'm sorry.

63
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,760
Weiyue...

64
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,522
(Account Book)

65
00:03:59,119 --> 00:04:00,079
The negative energy here is heavy.

66
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:01,880
Let's go to a temple to pray after this.

67
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,280
Let's go.

68
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:13,000
(I knew the edge was poisoned
the moment I saw that blind box.)

69
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:15,840
(Good thing my body
has excellent medical skills.)

70
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:19,079
(Mo Xuanji's Bedchamber)
So I pretended to be poisoned.

71
00:04:19,159 --> 00:04:21,440
(Two birds with one stone.)

72
00:04:22,239 --> 00:04:23,400
(That's me, all right.)

73
00:04:24,559 --> 00:04:25,519
(Account book...)

74
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:28,239
(Where is the account book hidden?)

75
00:04:56,239 --> 00:04:57,119
Weiyue,

76
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,760
I'm sorry.

77
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:01,800
I'm sorry.

78
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,360
(Don't tell me Mo Yuya)

79
00:05:05,559 --> 00:05:07,679
- I'm sorry.
- (really thinks I'm dead?)

80
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:10,000
(He's even crying for me.)

81
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:21,559
Mo Xuanji.

82
00:05:22,559 --> 00:05:24,320
For my wife's death,

83
00:05:24,559 --> 00:05:26,360
I will settle the score

84
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,039
between us.

85
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,599
Mother, let's go.

86
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,679
(Mo Yuya, you want war?)

87
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:42,199
(I'll see it through to the end.)

88
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,599
No more pretending.

89
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,559
You knew I was awake?

90
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:57,639
And you still cried?

91
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,519
I didn't cry.

92
00:06:01,119 --> 00:06:02,360
When I lifted you up,

93
00:06:02,559 --> 00:06:04,440
I already saw the account book,

94
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,440
and I understood everything.

95
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:07,599
Right, the account book.

96
00:06:08,039 --> 00:06:09,599
Is this the one?

97
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,404
(Account Book)

98
00:06:16,199 --> 00:06:17,119
Take it.

99
00:06:25,719 --> 00:06:26,599
Weiyue,

100
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,800
don't ever scare me like that again.

101
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,039
You hear me?

102
00:06:35,239 --> 00:06:36,039
Got it.

103
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,159
Mo Yuya,

104
00:06:51,119 --> 00:06:52,639
are you into me now?

105
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,280
Deceiving superiors,

106
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:18,760
lining your own pockets,

107
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,559
and preying on the people.

108
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,480
Water transport was in your hands
all these years,

109
00:07:21,599 --> 00:07:22,760
and you've made a complete mess of it.

110
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:23,599
What an absolute disgrace.

111
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:25,559
Spare us, Your Majesty!

112
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,599
Strip these parasites
of their official ranks,

113
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,480
confiscate their property,

114
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,760
and exile them to the frozen wastelands.

115
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,320
Spare us, Your Majesty!

116
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:31,800
Your Majesty!

117
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,119
Spare us, Your Majesty!

118
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:34,840
Please let us off!

119
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,039
Your Highness, just say the word,

120
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:38,119
and His Majesty will surely show mercy.

121
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:40,119
We'll serve you to repay you!

122
00:07:40,119 --> 00:07:40,519
Is that so?

123
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:43,119
Absolutely!

124
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:43,880
Your Highness!

125
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,360
I can speak to His Majesty

126
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,880
and ask him to show mercy

127
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,719
and spare your lives.

128
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,000
But

129
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,880
you must reveal

130
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,440
who is behind all this.

131
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,920
I... There's no one behind me.

132
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,239
I did this alone,
and I'll take the blame alone.

133
00:08:17,119 --> 00:08:19,000
Such loyalty.

134
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,680
Is she really worth

135
00:08:22,319 --> 00:08:24,000
dying to protect?

136
00:08:25,119 --> 00:08:25,920
No,

137
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,640
you don't understand at all.

138
00:08:29,119 --> 00:08:30,600
Betraying you

139
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,279
means death at most.

140
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,520
But betraying her...

141
00:08:42,359 --> 00:08:43,319
Uncle Yuya.

142
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,800
How did it go, Your Highness?

143
00:08:54,439 --> 00:08:55,680
Deeply rooted.

144
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,560
Mo Xuanji has run rampant in court
for years,

145
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,439
yet not one person dares
to implicate her.

146
00:09:01,079 --> 00:09:02,920
It seems to catch Mo Xuanji,

147
00:09:04,239 --> 00:09:05,840
we need to find

148
00:09:06,319 --> 00:09:08,479
more direct and serious evidence.

149
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:12,239
So what do we do?

150
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:17,800
Mo Xuanji

151
00:09:18,359 --> 00:09:20,199
has controlled water transport
for years.

152
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,560
She must have ulterior motives.

153
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:25,439
And the canal water transport

154
00:09:25,439 --> 00:09:27,960
has always been a vital trade route
between Yinbei and foreign merchants.

155
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,159
Besides embezzlement,

156
00:09:32,239 --> 00:09:33,279
perhaps

157
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,560
there are many other secrets
hidden there.

158
00:09:37,479 --> 00:09:38,039
Understood.

159
00:09:38,039 --> 00:09:42,820
(Mountain Winds, Silent Woods)

160
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:43,840
Boss!

161
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,479
Boss,

162
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:48,239
I made a major discovery!

163
00:09:52,319 --> 00:09:53,239
What discovery?

164
00:09:54,319 --> 00:09:55,000
Boss,

165
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:57,800
you sent me with your mother to get
her prenatal medicine today, right?

166
00:09:58,119 --> 00:10:00,079
But when I went to get the medicine,
one herb was missing.

167
00:10:00,399 --> 00:10:01,399
The shopkeeper told me

168
00:10:01,479 --> 00:10:02,640
that herb is very rare.

169
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,279
It's only found near Luyun City.

170
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:05,800
But the herb farmer
who usually supplies it

171
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,159
hasn't come for days.

172
00:10:07,439 --> 00:10:09,800
Most likely he was killed in Kugu Ridge.

173
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,920
Kugu Ridge?

174
00:10:14,239 --> 00:10:17,199
Yunlu City has had rumors of people
being eaten in the deep mountains.

175
00:10:17,439 --> 00:10:19,520
They're probably
talking about Kugu Ridge.

176
00:10:20,439 --> 00:10:22,479
Any herb farmer
who ventures into Kugu Ridge,

177
00:10:22,479 --> 00:10:23,600
even a little too deep,

178
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,680
vanishes without a trace,

179
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,920
bones and all.

180
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,359
Boss,

181
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:30,720
if this rumor is true,

182
00:10:32,239 --> 00:10:33,840
doesn't it remind you of something?

183
00:10:42,079 --> 00:10:42,680
That's right.

184
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:45,279
A space wormhole!

185
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,560
Oh.

186
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,920
Take it.

187
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:52,720
If the geology

188
00:10:53,079 --> 00:10:55,000
of Kugu Ridge is special

189
00:10:55,319 --> 00:10:57,119
and forms a spatial magnetic field,

190
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:58,920
it really could be a space wormhole.

191
00:10:58,920 --> 00:10:59,359
Exactly!

192
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:02,199
Once people step into this wormhole,

193
00:11:02,479 --> 00:11:03,960
they get sucked into the magnetic field,

194
00:11:04,199 --> 00:11:05,199
just like us,

195
00:11:05,399 --> 00:11:06,760
and fall into another time and space.

196
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:07,199
Right!

197
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:10,439
The locals think people who go in
can't come out.

198
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:13,439
Over time, the rumor
that Kugu Ridge eats people took hold.

199
00:11:14,319 --> 00:11:14,720
Right.

200
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,640
Oh.

201
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,479
I thought
because my bracelet was broken,

202
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:20,920
even when the three-star alignment comes

203
00:11:21,079 --> 00:11:22,479
or the Time and Space Bureau's people
show up,

204
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,399
we still couldn't go back.

205
00:11:24,079 --> 00:11:25,039
But now

206
00:11:25,239 --> 00:11:26,399
there's hope again!

207
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,439
Boss,

208
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,840
what are we waiting for?

209
00:11:34,119 --> 00:11:36,000
This wormhole's existence is unstable.

210
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:37,640
Let's pack our bags and go.

211
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,640
Let's go.

212
00:11:43,359 --> 00:11:44,840
Boss, what are you waiting for?

213
00:11:45,079 --> 00:11:47,760
We're going back to the 21st century
where we used to live.

214
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,159
You don't want to go back?

215
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:57,840
You have to give me some time to pack.

216
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:00,319
Are you sure?

217
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,520
You should hurry back.

218
00:12:09,119 --> 00:12:10,279
Geezer.

219
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:13,720
Hey, my hairpin!

220
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,199
Feng Weiyue.

221
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,119
You're a modern person.

222
00:12:37,039 --> 00:12:38,960
Now that you finally have a chance
to go home,

223
00:12:40,119 --> 00:12:41,560
you're reluctant to leave?

224
00:12:54,079 --> 00:12:55,399
Are you going on a trip?

225
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,720
Didn't we agree before?

226
00:13:01,199 --> 00:13:02,399
I steal the account book for you,

227
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,920
cure your poisoning,
and then we divorce.

228
00:13:06,359 --> 00:13:08,239
Now my tasks are all done.

229
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,279
So please,

230
00:13:09,279 --> 00:13:10,000
just let me go.

231
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:13,479
There's no rush on the divorce.

232
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:17,800
I don't think the poison in my body
is fully cured yet.

233
00:13:19,439 --> 00:13:20,439
I'm the doctor here.

234
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,760
I say it's cured, so it's cured.

235
00:13:22,079 --> 00:13:22,720
Feng Weiyue,

236
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,560
do you really not understand
what I mean?

237
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:28,159
Please, Your Highness, have a heart.

238
00:13:28,319 --> 00:13:29,960
You've used me,
and you're done using me.

239
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:33,039
Just honor our agreement

240
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:34,600
and divorce me.

241
00:13:36,119 --> 00:13:37,520
In your eyes,

242
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:40,640
am I nothing but someone who uses you?

243
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:43,640
What else?

244
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:46,479
You wanted to lure out
Xingzhao Pavilion,

245
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:48,159
and you used me to do it.

246
00:13:48,439 --> 00:13:50,159
You wanted to deal with your sister
and steal the account book,

247
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:52,039
and you used me for that too.

248
00:13:53,199 --> 00:13:55,119
You never had feelings for me
in these three years.

249
00:13:56,319 --> 00:13:57,840
It's time we parted on good terms.

250
00:14:02,479 --> 00:14:04,000
(I'm sorry, Mo Yuya.)

251
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,359
(I don't belong here.)

252
00:14:07,439 --> 00:14:09,119
(This is my only chance to go back.)

253
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:30,760
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

254
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,283
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

255
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:37,321
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

256
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:40,122
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

257
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:44,132
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

258
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,922
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

259
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:52,521
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

260
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,801
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

261
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:01,119
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

262
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,920
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

263
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,481
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

264
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:11,642
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

265
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:14,361
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

266
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,280
♪This love remains unchanged♪

267
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:19,800
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

268
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:23,958
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

269
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:28,080
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

270
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,841
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

271
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:33,040
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

272
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:34,478
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

273
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:37,839
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

274
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:42,161
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

275
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:44,519
♪I don't regret that vow♪

